    <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
      <body>
        <div rend="parallel">
          <p xml:id="Aink431-kilavi">pirivu uṭampaṭṭum āṟṟāyākiṉṟatu eṉṉai eṉṟu viṉaviyavaḻi avar pōṉa curam pōkaṟku aritu eṉṟu āṟṟēṉ ākiṉṟēṉ eṉṟa talaimakaṭku vēṉiṟkālam kaḻintatu; kārpparuvattōṟṟattilē pirintār ākalāṉ accuram naṉṟu eṉat tōḻi colli āṟṟuvittatu.</p>
          <p xml:lang="en">After asking, 'And having agreed to the separation, why is it that you have become unable to endure [it]?', to the heroine who said, 'Thinking of the wasteland through which he goes that is difficult to traverse, I have become unable to endure [it]', so as to say, 'The hot season has passed; because he left when the rainy season appeared, that wasteland is good', the confidante reassured [the heroine] by speaking [this].</p>
            </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
          <lg xml:id="Aink431">        
<l>naṉṟē kātalar ceṉṟa vāṟē</l>
<l>yaṇiniṟa virumpoṟai mīmicai</l>
<l>maṇiniṟa vuruviṉa tōkaiyu muṭaittē.</l>
        </lg>  
 <lg xml:lang="en">                    
<l>The way along which the lover went is good --</l>
<l>high atop the great hill of beautiful colour,</l>
<l>it has peacocks of sapphire-coloured form as well.</l>
          </lg>                      
        </div>
      </body>
    </text>
